<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap faqlist">
    <div class="acc">
      <div class="acc__item open"><button class="acc__head" type="button">What exactly is PDRN? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">PDRN (polydeoxyribonucleotide) is made of small DNA fragments derived from salmon. They're structurally similar to human DNA, so skin tolerates them well — it's prized in K-beauty for supporting repair, resilience and a plump, glazed look.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">What's in the formula? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">Salmon-DNA PDRN, hydrolyzed collagen, hyaluronic acid and plumping peptides, plus caffeine and vitamin E — a K-beauty-inspired pink collagen balm. Full ingredients are on every carton{% if pages['ingredients'] != blank %}, and on our <a href="{{ pages['ingredients'].url }}">ingredients page</a>{% endif %}.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">How often can I use it? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">As often as you like — morning, night, and any time skin feels tight or dull. Swipe, pat in, glow.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">Can I wear it with makeup? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">Absolutely. It glides on over or under makeup without pilling, so you can refresh your glow throughout the day.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">Is it vegan? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">No. The PDRN is salmon-derived, so the balm isn't vegan. If you have a fish or marine allergy, please skip it.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">What skin types is it for? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">All skin types, especially anyone wanting more plump, bounce and dewiness, or to soften the look of fine lines. As always, patch test first.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">When will I see results? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">Skin looks dewier and more cushioned right after you swipe. For the look of fine lines and firmness, most people use it daily for a few weeks. Results vary.</div></div></div>
      <div class="acc__item"><button class="acc__head" type="button">Shipping &amp; returns? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="acc__body"><div class="acc__body-inner">Free shipping over $35 (and on every trio), flat $4.95 below. Orders ship in 1–2 business days. Not glowing? Return within 30 days for a full refund.</div></div></div>
    </div>
    {%- if pages['contact'] != blank -%}<div class="center" style="margin-top:2.5rem"><a href="{{ pages['contact'].url }}" class="btn btn-outline">Still curious? Contact us</a></div>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

